{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T10:46:49.828Z","author":"pi-gh-blockers","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"83097eb018453e49a23eaf19","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T10:46:49.828Z"},{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments","value":[{"created_at":"2026-10-12T10:46:49.828Z","author":"pi-gh-blockers","text":"Claimed and started. Companion item: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli-website/blob/main/.agents/pm/features/pm-cli-website-5o9j.toon — this implements the blocker-revalidation capability the companion item calls for, in pm-github where the GitHub client, auth handling and provenance model already live. Design summary: complete pm list read (same receipts as import), candidate selection = status blocked OR non-terminal with an external GitHub blocked_by dependency, reference parsing across blocked_reason/description/comments, batched GraphQL state queries, report-only verdicts, idempotent --comment, wired into the reusable scheduled sync workflow as a report-only step."}]}],"before_hash":"cfee342c518a474f85ae16d112b10933d843bd241e058c8dd62db6324de9e83a","after_hash":"b5bd30fe4eb0d8b086325ea31661700d6fae925336b8070847694cb72ae80b6f","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"554a254e85e638a6734ca4e385e73208630b541a83f639c53676407f55bbb586"}
{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-12T10:55:14.500Z","author":"pi-gh-blockers","author_source":"asserted","agent_harness":"pi","agent_model":"glm-5.3:cloud","agent_model_source":"environment","agent_instance":"83097eb018453e49a23eaf19","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"glm-5.3:cloud","source":"environment"},"effort":null,"role":null,"topic":null},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-12T10:55:14.500Z","author":"pi-gh-blockers","text":"Implementation drafted in the package worktree: complete-read refactor (runCompletePmList shared by readPmItems and the new readBlockerPmItems), BlockerPmItem decoder validating blocked_reason/blocked_by/dependencies/comments on top of the existing complete-corpus receipts, reference parser (URL, owner/repo#N, GH-N, name#N, bare #N; gitlab/jira/linear locators masked, github: locator scheme unwrapped), hint resolution against the item's gh: provenance repo then --repo, batched GraphQL state query (issue+pullRequest per number, repos deduped+sorted so recorded fixtures stay stable), verdict function, idempotent --comment with per-item lock, report + exit codes (0 nothing cleared, 4 cleared, 2 usage/token, 1 total state failure). Real GraphQL fixtures recorded from api.github.com: unbraind/pm-cli#854 closed 2026-08-01 (the motivating blocker), #1246 open, PR #34 merged, #999999 not found, plus a repository-not-found and a data-null error response."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-12T10:55:14.500Z"}],"before_hash":"b5bd30fe4eb0d8b086325ea31661700d6fae925336b8070847694cb72ae80b6f","after_hash":"fb282546565cb9fa38707e0b12dc13b54fa2d532d235aa5c1eaf6579cd195d00","item_hash_version":3,"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"258e00c59caa340d33144a8eed0f92319547f9eaead82b76cd52b6fae3c2f193"}
